      "dcterms:title": "Geometry of higher helicities",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "KHESIN, BORIS A."
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20040302",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We revisit an interpretation of higher-dimensional helicities and Hopf–Novikov invariants from the point of view of the Brownian ergodic theorem. We also survey various results related to Arnold’s the- orem on the asymptotic Hopf invariant on three-dimensional manifolds and recent work on linking of a vector ﬁeld with a foliation, the asymp- totic crossing number, short path systems, and relations with the Calabi invariant. 2000 Math. Subj. Class. 37A15, 55Q25, 76W05.",
